== Walkthrough ==

Follow Mooto (assuming nobody kills him) and when he gets to the orc camp he will say:

"Orcs have infiltrated our area.  I will reward anyone who shows me proof of their death."

As a wolf you can hail Mooto and he responds "You would be wise to leave my sight while you still can.  Unless you have something to give me."

Giving the DeathFist Slashed Belt and Pawn Scalp did not result in anything, so I'm not sure what he needs, or if the quest works. 

